  "summary": "What's Changed Create Mod Inbox settings screen by @ds-boyce in #11640 Create mod inbox report details screen by @ds-boyce in #11641 Use title case for Starter Pack by @ds-boyce in #11653 APP-3031: Fix contact imports after Expo 57 by @mozzius in #11658 Migrate Expo image manipulator API by @mozzius in #11661 Add carousel Slack alerts for nightly Maestro fa…",
  "content": "<h2>What&#x27;s Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Create Mod Inbox settings screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11640\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11640</a></li>\n<li>Create mod inbox report details screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11641\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11641</a></li>\n<li>Use title case for Starter Pack by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11653\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11653</a></li>\n<li>APP-3031: Fix contact imports after Expo 57 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11658\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11658</a></li>\n<li>Migrate Expo image manipulator API by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11661\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11661</a></li>\n<li>Add carousel Slack alerts for nightly Maestro failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11645\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11645</a></li>\n<li>Create Mod Inbox action details screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11657\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11657</a></li>\n<li>Bump version from 1.132.0 to 1.133.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11663\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11663</a></li>\n<li>Add more data to trending metrics by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11565\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11565</a></li>\n<li>Fix Android thread number alignment across font scales by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11667\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11667</a></li>\n<li>Restore expanded post styles by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11668\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11668</a></li>\n<li>Move repository instructions to AGENTS.md by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11669\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11669</a></li>\n<li>Fix hidden adult content takes time to appear by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11469\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11469</a></li>\n<li>Remove content visibility + SP search feature flags by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11675\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11675</a></li>\n<li>Remove native Reanimated dependency array by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11678\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11678</a></li>\n<li>Use useEffectEvent for effects with deliberately narrow deps by <a href=\"https://github.com/tomekzaw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tomekzaw</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11550\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11550</a></li>\n<li>Back off metrics uploads when the tracking endpoint is unreachable by <a href=\"https://github.com/Minhal128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@Minhal128</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11683\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11683</a></li>\n<li>APP-3049: Fix scrolling in oversized Android sheets by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11693\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11693</a></li>\n<li>Handle push token fetch failures by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11679\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11679</a></li>\n<li>Bump rn-worklets to 0.12.2 by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11698\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11698</a></li>\n<li>Improve logging and error handling for CAPTCHA by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11697\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11697</a></li>\n<li>Fix multi-language composer selection indicator by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11702\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11702</a></li>\n<li>APP-3021: use static AppView DID for E2E by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11646\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11646</a></li>\n<li>Fix localization of the &quot;Discover&quot; feed on the &quot;My Feeds&quot; screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/tkusano\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@tkusano</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11704\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11704</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade pnpm to 11.23.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11707\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11707</a></li>\n<li>Fix no scroll when the new line is entered by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11715\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11715</a></li>\n<li>Respect device 24-hour clock preference by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11709\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11709</a></li>\n<li>fix profile hover popup disappearing near the top of screens by <a href=\"https://github.com/devxan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@devxan</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11712\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11712</a></li>\n<li>Fix zizmor self-repository findings by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11725\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11725</a></li>\n<li>APP-3082: remove legacy notification priority state by <a href=\"https://github.com/rafaeleyng\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@rafaeleyng</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11734\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11734</a></li>\n<li>Fix jumpy text in alt text edit screen by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11716\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11716</a></li>\n<li>Replace nightly build with a nightly changelog post; add OTA fallback iOS build to QA Team by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11673\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11673</a></li>\n<li>Defer Explore feed previews and reuse fresh feed queries by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11719\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11719</a></li>\n<li>Bump Expo 57 patch versions by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11724\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11724</a></li>\n<li>Migrate to new header for topics passthrough by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11571\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11571</a></li>\n<li>Read device ID directly in analytics context by <a href=\"https://github.com/estrattonbailey\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@estrattonbailey</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11742\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11742</a></li>\n<li>Webpack -&gt; Metro migration by <a href=\"https://github.com/abulenok\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@abulenok</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11431\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11431</a></li>\n<li>Add canonical release model by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11648\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11648</a></li>\n<li>Improve Google search snippets by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11746\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11746</a></li>\n<li>Use Claude Opus 5.5 for CI reviews by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11758\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11758</a></li>\n<li>Enable Sentry tombstones by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11671\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11671</a></li>\n<li>keep the ios splash above app content by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11708\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11708</a></li>\n<li>APP-3022: enable R8 minification for Android releases by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11647\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11647</a></li>\n<li>Bump the actions group across 1 directory with 6 updates by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@dependabot</a>[bot] in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11741\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11741</a></li>\n<li>Revert &quot;Use Claude Opus 5.5 for CI reviews&quot; by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11760\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11760</a></li>\n<li>Fix nightly E2E environment after Metro migration by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11759\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11759</a></li>\n<li>APP-3107 Check web bundle browser support in CI by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11761</a></li>\n<li>APP-3081: Default posts to primary language and keep language changes local by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11732\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11732</a></li>\n<li>Configure starter pack size limits remotely by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11706\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11706</a></li>\n<li>Add logging for recommended feeds and starter packs by <a href=\"https://github.com/ds-boyce\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@ds-boyce</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11701\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11701</a></li>\n<li>Bump fingerprint-native to v0.4.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11735\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11735</a></li>\n<li>Remove iOS 15 compatibility code by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11751\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11751</a></li>\n<li>Upgrade Sentry React Native to 8.26.0 by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11674\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11674</a></li>\n<li>Surface GrowthBook flags in Sentry issues by <a href=\"https://github.com/mozzius\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@mozzius</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11676\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11676</a></li>\n<li>1.133 release prep by <a href=\"https://github.com/vineyardbovines\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@vineyardbovines</a> in <a href=\"https://github.com/bluesky-social/social-app/pull/11766\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">#11766</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>New Contributors</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/Minhal128\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">@Minhal128</a> made their first contribution in <a href=\"https://githu